BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Medicine & the Muse Program in Medical Humanities & the Arts] Sta
 nford Future of Medicine Workshop: Accessing & Assessing Medical Truth in 
 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T160000
DTSTAMP:20260910T165449Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53801176482521-53801176482522@local-events
DESCRIPTION:As artificial intelligence\, digital media\, and data-driven s
 ystems increasingly shape healthcare\, the question of how we access\, ass
 ess\, and trust medical truth has become urgent. This workshop brings toge
 ther clinicians\, researchers\, students\, educators\, and industry innova
 tors to examine how emerging technologies influence what counts as knowled
 ge in medicine\, and who gets to decide.\n\nThrough six lectures from lead
 ers in medical ethics\, journalism\, and healthcare\, participants will ex
 plore how\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.futureofmed.com/\nLast sy
 nced: 2026-09-10 09:54 PDT
LOCATION:Li Ka Shing Center
URL:https://www.futureofmed.com/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Hoover] The Alliance for Civics in the Academy discussing What’
 s New in Civics for 2026?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260910T100000
DTSTAMP:20260910T165449Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53851653662919-53851653663944@local-events
DESCRIPTION:To inaugurate the second season of Civics in the Academy\, we 
 explore some of the new civics-related programs emerging across American i
 nstitutions of higher education. ACA Executive Committee member Jenna Stor
 ey talks with Roosevelt Montas (Chang Chavkin Center on Liberal Education 
 and Civic Life\, Bard College) and William Howell (School of Government an
 d Policy\, Johns Hopkins University) about their respective endeavors and 
 assesses with them the broader movement to strengthen civic education i\n
 \nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.hoover.org/events/whats-new-civics-2
 026\nLast synced: 2026-09-10 09:54 PDT
URL:https://www.hoover.org/events/whats-new-civics-2026
END:VEVENT
